{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/09ecf640f05cce384bf043112cbdc104.poster.avif?t=1753186109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/09ecf640f05cce384bf043112cbdc104.webm?t=1753186109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/09ecf640f05cce384bf043112cbdc104.mp4?t=1753186109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up in the middle of the night, trapped inside a subway car.</strong><br>The lights flicker, the silence is suffocating\u2026 and there\u2019s no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you go through the door, you return to the same place. The car repeats. Time folds.<br>Something is broken \u2014 or watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there are signs. Hidden rules. Patterns.<br>Only those who pay close attention can break the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the puzzles, follow the rules, and escape the loop \u2014 before whatever lurks in the shadows realizes you're trying to flee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/725591dc8c308f1fe126d48c7169731e.poster.avif?t=1753186109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/725591dc8c308f1fe126d48c7169731e.webm?t=1753186109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/725591dc8c308f1fe126d48c7169731e.mp4?t=1753186109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unpredictable Monster:</strong>\u00a0A relentless entity stalks the corridors, reacting to your actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Claustrophobic Atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0Dynamic lighting, ambient sounds, and a tense soundtrack fully immerse you in horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emergent Puzzles:</strong>\u00a0Challenges that adapt to your progress and each car\u2019s unique mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fragmented Narrative:</strong>\u00a0Notes and documents scattered across the train unveil the truth behind the terror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/468b23985209d33ef92afc64065ec14a.poster.avif?t=1753186109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/468b23985209d33ef92afc64065ec14a.webm?t=1753186109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/extras/468b23985209d33ef92afc64065ec14a.mp4?t=1753186109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready \u2014 each ride could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have the courage to board?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734560?t=1753186109","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734560?t=1753186109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734560/92bc797447e664d7aaea3e9ef05e32b021c8ca5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753186109","capsule_imagev5":"https://sha